! 天气文件:Dry bulb temperature ->Environment temperature                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       4,1                                      4,2                                      23,1                                    
